    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/ad7170ead022be5abd93811811089377.poster.avif?t=1732240771\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/ad7170ead022be5abd93811811089377.webm?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/ad7170ead022be5abd93811811089377.mp4?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Explore this hand built world where nothing is as it seems!    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Uncover the <strong>BIG</strong> secrets of Little Laboratories Inc!<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/f25ff6b7e54315497421ac98f1de34bc.poster.avif?t=1732240771\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/f25ff6b7e54315497421ac98f1de34bc.webm?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/f25ff6b7e54315497421ac98f1de34bc.mp4?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<u>Included Features:</u>\u00a0   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Mild Horror Elements   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Spooky Chases   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Jump Scares   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Charming Characters<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Hidden Secrets   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Easy To Understand Puzzles   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Collectable Lore   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Grab and Toss Physics Objects\u00a0   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Interesting and Unique Story   <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25ba\u00a0 \u00a0 Respects Player's Time (Approx. 40 min length)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/df963927fba83be88cf9396afd5a8715.poster.avif?t=1732240771\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/df963927fba83be88cf9396afd5a8715.webm?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/df963927fba83be88cf9396afd5a8715.mp4?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/036a106a4ca31e68271b71110aa797ac.poster.avif?t=1732240771\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/036a106a4ca31e68271b71110aa797ac.webm?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292220/extras/036a106a4ca31e68271b71110aa797ac.mp4?t=1732240771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
